1
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,020
谢谢
Thank you.

2
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,280
有试喝
Samples!

3
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,640
打扰一下 我认识你吗
Excuse me, do I know you?

4
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,580
恐怕不吧
I don't think so.

5
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:31,700
你好面熟 我怎么想到了长椅上的广告
You look so familiar. Why am I picturing a bench ad?

6
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,780
小有名气 不得不承认了
Minor celebrity. Guilty as charged.

7
00:00:34,165 --> 00:00:36,687
你是牙医广告上那个人
You're the "Accidentes" guy.

8
00:00:36,741 --> 00:00:38,400
不 不 不
No. No, no, no.

9
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,280
我是...
Um, I'm, uh...

10
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,220
我是房地产先生 菲尔·邓菲
I'm Mr. Real Estate -- Phil Dunphy.

11
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,360
对
Oh, right.

12
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:46,140
其实我最近正在找房子
I am actually looking for a house right now.

13
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,998
如果我能帮得上忙的话
Well, if I could be of any service...

14
00:00:47,998 --> 00:00:49,420
我没 我手头没有名片
I don't -- I don't have any cards.

15
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:50,038
我穿的是去健身房的衣服
I'm in my gym clothes.

16
00:00:50,038 --> 00:00:52,840
看来那杯热巧克力是锻炼后的奖赏啦
Oh, I see you earned that hot chocolate.

17
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,125
是啊 我刚刚进行了一次
Yeah, I rocked a pretty intense

18
00:00:54,125 --> 00:00:55,479
高强度摇哑铃快步走
Shake Weights/Power Walk Combo.

19
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,820
早上好 邻居们
Morning, neighbors.

20
00:00:57,540 --> 00:01:00,500
我昨天看到了你女儿 家有小女初长成
Saw your daughter yesterday. Boy, she is growing up fast.

21
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,240
我叫安吉
My name is Angie.

22
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:06,337
这是我的号码
Here is my number.

23
00:01:06,337 --> 00:01:09,360
如果你在这附近有看到什么三卧室的房子
If you find any good three-bedrooms in the neighborhood,

24
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,140
可以介绍我看看
I'd love to see them.

25
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:12,000
我会给你打电话的 很愿意带你看房
Well, I'll call you. I'd love to show them to you.

26
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:13,541
我可不只有一张让人们坐的帅脸[板凳广告]
I'm not just a pretty face people sit on.

27
00:01:13,541 --> 00:01:14,865
当作没听见吧
Forget...I said that.

28
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,700
来了
Here you go.

29
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,680
谢谢 亲爱的
Oh, thanks, honey.

30
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,720
安吉是谁
Who's Angie?

31
00:01:23,455 --> 00:01:25,940
我刚在里面见到的一个女的
Just a woman I m-met inside.

32
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:27,520
是吗 她还给你她的号码了
Really? She gave you her number?

33
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:29,280
还把"i"上的点画成了小爱心
And dotted her "i" with a little heart?

34
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:30,940
对啦 她在找房子
Oh, yeah. She's looking for a house.

35
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:31,700
温柔的老女人
Sweet old lady.

36
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,920
我不知道我为什么那么说
Don't know why I said that.

37
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:33,660
有点胖
Little overweight.

38
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,260
不知道我怎么想的
No idea where that came from.

39
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:36,360
非常重的爱尔兰口音
Thick Irish accent.

40
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,200
我慌神了
I panicked!

41
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:38,520
我应该说实话的
I should have told the truth,

42
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,980
但是克莱尔知道我 有个喜欢的类型
but Claire knows I have... a type.

43
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,500
那只是个善意[白人]的谎言
It was just a little white lie.

44
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:45,220
很讽刺吧
Ironically.

45
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:00,940
你好 美国
Hey, America!

46
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,860
我没看到你们来了
I didn't see you there.

47
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:06,020
欢迎来到全新的网络直播节目"杰说心语"
Welcome to another live webcast of "Jay Talking."

48
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:07,840
你们知道我很讨厌什么吗
You know what really gets my goat?

49
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,100
山羊奶酪
Goat cheese.

50
00:02:09,580 --> 00:02:10,280
到处都有
It's on everything.

51
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:11,740
我讨厌死了
I hate it.

52
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:13,580
唯一比山羊奶酪更讨厌的是
The only thing worse than goat cheese

53
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:15,440
跟一些在室内戴帽子的傻瓜
is eating it at a communal table

54
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:17,840
一起在公共场合吃那玩意儿
with some jerk wearing a hat inside.

55
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:19,260
放尊重点
Have some respect.

56
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,600
把裤子拉上去
And pull up your pants!

57
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:22,700
我唯一想看到的裂纹是独立钟上的那条
Only crack I want to see is in the Liberty Bell.

58
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:25,560
地球上最棒的国家
Greatest country on the damn planet.

59
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,140
如果六个月前
If, six months ago,

60
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:29,000
你告诉我我会办一个很厉害的网络节目
you'd have told me I'd have a big Internet show,

61
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,500
我会说那挺合理的
I would have said, "Yeah, that adds up."

62
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:33,100
我以前常常用笑话和评论逗乐我的员工们
I used to entertain my staff with jokes and observations.

63
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,300
我退休后
When I retired,

64
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,200
我开始也在这家里这么干
I started sharing those gems around the house.

65
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:39,260
结果曼尼太喜欢了 于是建了个网络直播站
Manny went so nuts for it, he set up the whole webcast.

66
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,800
抱歉 互联网 把锅甩给你们了
Sorry, Internet. He's your problem now.

67
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:44,060
你们一天圈这人圈那人倒还不那么招人厌
Bottom line, you can keep your hashtags,

68
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:46,837
因为我喜欢炸薯饼[谐音]
'cause I like hashbrowns.

69
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:47,480
但是...
But, hey...

70
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:49,500
那只是"杰说心语"
that's just "Jay Talking."

71
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:55,700
结束了
And we're out.

72
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,000
90分钟时间飞逝
90 minutes just flew by.

73
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:58,760
各位
Hey, guys!

74
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:01,380
评论已经进来了
The comments are already rolling in!

75
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,760
"继续下去 杰"
"Keep it up, Jay."

76
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:04,780
"你说的正是我们想的"
"You're saying what we're all thinking."

77
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:06,540
"我也好想念炒杂碎[美式中菜]"
"I miss Chop Suey, too."

78
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:07,440
我爱死了
I love it,

79
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,580
因为大家都会看到我天天要忍受什么了
because now everybody gets to see what I live with.

80
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,660
什么情况 又是这个家伙
What the hell? This guy again?

81
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,194
谁
Who?

82
00:03:11,194 --> 00:03:13,900
一个名叫"女士杀手52"的傻瓜
Some meatball named "LadyKiller52"

83
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:14,740
已经连续骚扰我好几天了
been dogging me for days.

84
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:15,340
看看他写了什么
Look what he wrote.

85
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:18,240
“老头 没人管你想什么"
"Hey, Grandpa, no one cares what you think."

86
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,581
你确定那不是海莉说的吗
Are you sure that that's not from Haley?

87
00:03:20,581 --> 00:03:22,160
这还有一条 还是那个傻瓜发的
Here's another one. The same jerk!

88
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,200
"真奇怪你居然不喜欢山羊奶酪"
"It's weird you don't like goat cheese

89
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,800
"你长得就像山羊啊"
when you've got a goat face."

90
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:27,020
这说不通啊
Well, that makes no sense.

91
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:29,220
什么山羊会吃自己的奶酪啊
What kind of goat eats its own cheese?

92
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:32,920
我来这里 想为美国人带来欢笑 引发思考
Here I am, trying to make America laugh and think,

93
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:35,477
结果这个傻瓜老是跑来骂我
and this hockey puck's coming at me with tired insults.

94
00:03:35,477 --> 00:03:36,960
好吧 他就是在故意煽动 杰
Okay, I-it's called a troll, Jay.

95
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,880
但你不能让他或者任何什么事情
But you can't let him or anything else

96
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,620
阻止你把你的所有想法
keep you from directing all of your opinions

97
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:41,460
都传到电脑里
into that computer.

98
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:42,279
没错 曼尼
You're right, Manny.

99
00:03:42,279 --> 00:03:44,469
做公众人物确实不容易
It's tough being in the public eye.

100
00:03:44,589 --> 00:03:47,000
总算知道辛纳特拉[美国歌手]为什么老打人了
Now I know why Sinatra was always punching guys.

101
00:03:48,580 --> 00:03:49,560
好啊 克莱尔
Hola, Claire.

102
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:51,340
怎么了
What's going on?

103
00:03:51,340 --> 00:03:53,289
你经常做瑜伽对吧
You do a lot of yoga, right?

104
00:03:53,289 --> 00:03:54,500
以前啦
Ah, I used to.

105
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:55,700
但是跟那些扎着马尾
But all those judgy vegans

106
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,339
穿着紧身裤的圣母严格素食主义者在一起
with their ponytails and their Lululemon,

107
00:03:57,339 --> 00:04:00,142
我觉得自己土鳖还是待在家里算了 你懂吧
I'm like, "Nama-stay home," You know what I mean?

108
00:04:02,020 --> 00:04:03,700
我刚开始学
I just started taking it,

109
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:06,460
但我觉得那个教练喜欢上我了
but I think that the instructor is hitting on me.

110
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:07,740
-没错 -你怎么知道
- He is. - How do you know?

111
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:09,400
因为你穿着瑜伽裤[很紧绷]呢
Because you're you in yoga pants.

112
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,500
换个课上吧
Just go to another class.

113
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,958
但是这课真的很好
But this one is perfect.

114
00:04:12,958 --> 00:04:15,880
正好跟乔去上金宝贝同一时间
It's at the same time as Joe's Gymboree,

115
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,215
又在隔壁
right next door.

116
00:04:17,215 --> 00:04:19,220
要不你跟我一起去
Ay, why don't you come with me today

117
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:20,740
然后告诉我是不是我想太多了
and tell me if I'm just being crazy?

118
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:22,280
行啊 把具体信息发给我
Sure. Text me the info.

119
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,820
提醒她
Hey, remind her!

120
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:25,617
别忘了
And don't forget --

121
00:04:25,617 --> 00:04:29,120
今天有全新一集的"杰说心语"哦
today, all-new episode of "Jay Talking".

122
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,780
他要聊聊那些
He takes on restaurants

123
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:33,040
把菜单写在黑板上的饭馆
that write their menus on blackboards.

124
00:04:33,260 --> 00:04:35,240
我想要菜单在我手里的感觉
I want to feel a menu in my hands!

125
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:38,120
姐们
Hey, girl.

126
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,480
-你要干什么 -没什么
- What are you doing? - Nothing.

127
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:41,740
就是想跟你打个招呼 聊点事情
Just wanted to say hi, talk about stuff.

128
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,380
什么事情
What stuff?

129
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:44,540
我不知道 我只是想你了
I don't know. I just miss you.

130
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,800
什么都可以聊啊
We could talk about anything.

131
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:48,160
聊聊 水门事件怎么样
How about... Watergate?

132
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,440
比如 你觉得
Like, what would you say

133
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:50,660
改变美国政治最重要的
were the three most significant ways

134
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:51,900
三个方面是什么
it changed American politics?

135
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,260
把引文也说一下
Cite your sources.

136
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:54,800
我不会帮你写论文的
I'm not writing your essay.

137
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:56,360
好吧 复活节见
Okay. See you at Easter.

138
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:57,717
我回来了
I'm back.

139
00:04:57,717 --> 00:05:00,440
带"小心心"安吉看房看得怎么样了
How'd your showing with Angie-with-a-heart go?

140
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,080
还好吧 都挺正常的
Oh, fine. Uneventful.

141
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:03,219
乏善可陈
Nondescript.

142
00:05:03,219 --> 00:05:05,900
这个淋浴房好小啊
This shower's really small.

143
00:05:05,900 --> 00:05:07,300
你能想象我用这浴室吗
Could you imagine me in here?

144
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:11,840
非常奇怪 我跟她在一起待了两个小时
Weird thing -- I was with her for two hours,

145
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:13,000
放在人群里我还是认不出她
I couldn't pick her out of a crowd.

146
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,260
真的吗 太奇怪了
Really? That is weird.

147
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,220
没什么奇怪的啊
Nothing weird about it.

148
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,240
你刚刚说那很奇怪
You just said it was weird.

149
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,560
那确实很奇怪 亲一个
That's weird. Give me a kiss!

150
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:19,420
你在干什么呢 兄弟
What are you up to, buddy?

151
00:05:19,820 --> 00:05:21,320
写一篇关于尼克松总统的论文
Writing a paper on President Nixon.

152
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,740
好傻啊
What an idiot.

153
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,480
他拥有了一切 又因为一些愚蠢的谎言
He had it all and just threw it away

154
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,780
失去了这一切
because of some stupid lie.

155
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:26,960
也许他说出口之前
Well, maybe it came out of his mouth

156
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:27,860
都不知道自己在说什么
before he knew what he was saying.

157
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:31,140
然后他的谎越撒越多
Okay, but then he just kept lying over and over

158
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,340
接着要用更多的谎去圆
and making it worse and worse.

159
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:33,637
菲尔 安吉多大
Phil, how old is Angie?

160
00:05:33,637 --> 00:05:36,060
70岁 怎么了
Oh, uh, gosh... 70. Why?

161
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:37,577
我在想福赛斯街那套房子
I was thinking about that house on Forsyth.

162
00:05:37,577 --> 00:05:39,360
挺不错的 就是楼梯多了点
It's nice but has a lot of stairs.

163
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,980
不 她太胖了没法住
No. She's too... fat for that.

164
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:44,560
因此 我将从今天中午起
Therefore, I shall resign the presidency

165
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,020
辞去总统职务
effective at noon tomorrow.

166
00:05:46,020 --> 00:05:47,440
他要是说实话就好了
If only he had told the truth.

167
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,900
他陷得太深了
He was in too deep!

168
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:53,940
看看我买了什么
Check out what I got!

169
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,020
不用了 谢谢
No, thanks.

170
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,420
我们明天可以去公园
Thought we could go to the park tomorrow

171
00:05:56,420 --> 00:05:57,420
这样你就可以开始尝试学了
and you could finally learn.

172
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,700
尝尝水泥地的味道吗
What pavement tastes like?

173
00:05:58,940 --> 00:05:59,880
我不想去
I don't think so.

174
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:03,120
莉莉 等你准备好了随时可以用
Well, Lily, when you're ready, it's here for you.

175
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:05,180
米奇尔 我们能去卧室
Mitchell, can I, um, speak to you in the bedroom

176
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:06,680
聊聊床罩的事吗
about the, uh, dust ruffle?

177
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:08,440
别担心 "床罩"现在就走
Don't worry -- the dust ruffle's leaving.

178
00:06:11,780 --> 00:06:12,900
你干嘛这么做
Okay, why are you doing this?

179
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:14,380
我们得让莉莉学会骑车
We need Lily to get on this bike.

180
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,920
你为什么那么逼她这么紧
Why are you pushing this so hard?

181
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:17,140
很明显她害怕
She's clearly afraid.

182
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,040
她最近怕很多事
She's been afraid of a lot of things lately.

183
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:20,680
上周 她连衣橱门都不开
Last week, she wouldn't even open her closet door

184
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,919
因为她觉得里面有可怕的东西
because she thought something scary was in there.

185
00:06:22,919 --> 00:06:24,880
可能是你妈给她做的牛仔连身裤
Could be the denim jumpsuit your mom made her.

186
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:25,900
这是个关键时刻
This is a pivotal moment.

187
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,380
我们的孩子绝不能
We can't raise a child

188
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:29,980
连车都不会骑 或者害怕上飞机
who won't ride a bike or get on an airplane

189
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:31,520
或者不吃蛋黄酱
or eat mayonnaise.

190
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,920
跟口感有关 鸡蛋怎么会变成那个样子
It's a texture thing. How does egg become that?

191
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:36,058
明天学定了 她一定要骑上这部车
We are doing this tomorrow. She is getting on this bike.

192
00:06:36,058 --> 00:06:37,760
你急什么啊 她才八岁
What's the rush? She's 8 years old.

193
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,380
大部分她同龄的越南孩子都骑着单车去工作了
Most Vietnamese kids her age are already riding a bike to work.

194
00:06:41,964 --> 00:06:43,680
圣雄之手在哪
So, where's Mahatma Handsy?

195
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:46,600
我知道你很会玩瑜伽方面的双关语
I noticed that you have a lot of these yoga puns.

196
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,860
我觉得我们不需要用那些
I don't think we need any more.

197
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:49,540
合十礼
Namaste.

198
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,860
好吧 他还是老样子
Okay. Now I get the one from before.

199
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,920
我们没见过吧
We haven't met.

200
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:56,920
克莱尔
Claire.

201
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:57,740
克莱尔
Claire.

202
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,120
你真美
Beautiful.

203
00:06:59,362 --> 00:07:01,273
就像唐君鲁的日出一般
Like the sunrise in Tanjung Rhu.

204
00:07:01,273 --> 00:07:02,990
你身材很适合练瑜伽 以前练过吗
You have a great yoga body. You've done this before?

205
00:07:02,990 --> 00:07:04,708
挺久以前了 不过我是练过
Um, yeah. I mean, it's been a little while, but yeah.

206
00:07:04,708 --> 00:07:07,201
姿势很棒 很有力量
Great posture, strong core.

207
00:07:10,297 --> 00:07:11,443
你会享受一番的
We're going to have fun.

208
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:14,860
也许我最近压力有点大 不过我错了
Maybe I've just been stressed lately, but I was wrong.

209
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:17,000
瑜伽很有意思
Yoga felt good.

210
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,900
把臀部撅向天花板
We are lifting our hips towards the ceiling.

211
00:07:20,940 --> 00:07:21,820
很棒 克莱尔
Very nice, Claire.

212
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,460
拉很擅长指导
Ra was very supportive.

213
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,880
也许是我以前没找对教练
Maybe I just never had the right teacher.

214
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,080
我做对了吗
Am I doing it right?

215
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,400
而且还能免费停车
And they validate parking.

216
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,940
又来了一条
Another one?

217
00:07:39,940 --> 00:07:42,320
我受够了这个叫女士杀手的混蛋
I've had it with this LadyKiller son of a bitch.

218
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:43,860
他一整晚都在骂我的视频
He's been lobbing insults all night.

219
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:46,700
"蠢货 我能透过网络闻到你的呼吸"
"Hey, dumbbell, I can smell your breath through the Internet."

220
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,900
这应该不可能吧
They can't do that, right?

221
00:07:48,380 --> 00:07:49,980
杰 听听我这个局外人的意见
Jay, take it from a fellow performer --

222
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:51,540
如果你决定成为公众人物
If you're going to put yourself out there,

223
00:07:51,580 --> 00:07:53,380
那就要做好面对负面评论的
you need to let the criticism roll off your back.

224
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:55,620
说真的 我蛮惊讶的 你居然没有因为
I must say, I was impressed you didn't mope for a month

225
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:58,020
对你《音乐之声》上表现的恶评抑郁一整个月
after that brutal review of you in "Sound of Music".

226
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,120
你说什么呢 哪有评论啊
What are you talking about? There was no review.

227
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:01,600
那周学校没有校报
There was no school paper that week.

228
00:08:02,814 --> 00:08:05,220
就是啊 那周没有校报
Eeeeeexactly. There was no paper that week.

229
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:05,960
对啊
Oh, yeah.

230
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,400
你做了什么
What did you do?

231
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,300
我
I...

232
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:10,260
我不会傻站在这里
I am not going to stand here

233
00:08:10,260 --> 00:08:13,340
让你把校报被偷的错都怪在我身上
and let you accuse me of stealing all of those papers!

234
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:17,220
他没那么说
He didn't say that.

235
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,820
"看过曼尼·迪尔加多"
"After seeing Manny Delgado

236
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:21,700
"演崩了的冯特拉普上校"
mangle the role of Captain Von Trapp,

237
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:24,780
"我只想说 上帝啊 让他停下吧"
all I can say is "Doe-a-dear Lord, make it stop.

238
00:08:25,140 --> 00:08:27,560
"搞得我年纪轻轻就得开始吃抗抑郁药了"
I am 16 going on antidepressants.

239
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,380
"我想爬上所有山峰然后跳下来"
I wanted to climb every mountain and jump off."

240
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,200
什么老师会允许这种文章
What teacher allowed this?

241
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,460
爷爷好
Hey, Grandpa.

242
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:36,292
亲爱的
Hi, honey!

243
00:08:36,292 --> 00:08:37,560
真高兴你打电话过来
Oh, I'm so glad you called.

244
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,840
我这周真是太糟糕了
I've just been having the worst week.

245
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:40,980
我压力太大了
It's been so overwhelming and so much --

246
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:42,540
你知道该怎么办吗 喝杯鸡尾酒
You know what helps? A cocktail.

247
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,920
听着 我现在有个问题
Listen, I've got a situation.

248
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,940
你认识能够在网上
Do you know any computer nerds

249
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,460
查到人家身份的电脑死宅吗
that can track someone down on the Internet?

250
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:51,300
我应该认识一些
Yeah, I think I can find a few.

251
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:54,920
好了 很激动吧 莉莉
Okay! How exciting is this, Lily?

252
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,800
马上你就能学会骑单车了
In no time at all, you're gonna be a bike rider.

253
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:58,320
或者变成一具尸体
Or a corpse. Okay...

254
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,800
我知道你害怕 要是你能够说出
I know you're afraid, and sometimes it's helpful

255
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:04,440
自己究竟怕什么 会更有帮助
if you say exactly what you're afraid of out loud.

256
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,260
所以呢
So...?

257
00:09:05,260 --> 00:09:06,376
我害怕自己会摔倒
I'm afraid I'll fall

258
00:09:06,376 --> 00:09:08,440
因为我还没准备好而你一直逼我
because I'm not ready and you forced me,

259
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,540
我下半辈子都会记着这仇了
so for the rest of my life, I'll hold it against you.

260
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:11,479
而在其他时间
And then other times,

261
00:09:11,479 --> 00:09:13,898
还是应该克服困难坚持去学
it's just best to tamp it down and soldier on.

262
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,860
你把她从车上拽出来的时候我就说过了
I said this when you pried her out of the car,

263
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:18,500
我再说一遍 她不想学
and I'll say this again -- she doesn't want to do this!

264
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:20,700
她看到这有多简单就会想学了
She will when she sees how easy it is for me.

265
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:22,580
看吧 小菜一碟
See? Easy as pie!

266
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:25,201
莉莉 如果你不想学
Okay, look, Lily, if you don't want to do this --

267
00:09:25,201 --> 00:09:26,757
-我不想学 -好吧
- I don't want to do this. - Okay.

268
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:29,037
我没事
I'm good!

269
00:09:29,037 --> 00:09:31,080
听着 我会去跟爸爸说
Um... look. All right. I'm gonna talk to Daddy.

270
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,760
不过答应我你总有一天会学的
But just promise me you'll learn someday, okay?

271
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,600
还有你会去坐飞机
And that you'll get on a plane.

272
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,800
我为什么会不想上飞机 什么情况
Why wouldn't I get on a plane? What's wrong with them?

273
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,280
没事 飞机比车安全
Nothing. They're safer than cars.

274
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,940
车不安全吗 天哪
Cars aren't safe?! Oh, my God.

275
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,440
大爸来了
Okay! Look -- here's Daddy.

276
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:44,340
我平安地回来了
Here we are, safe and sound!

277
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,460
-发生什么事了 -没什么
- What's wrong? -Nothing.

278
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:47,740
我想到吃完早餐以后忘了关烤箱
I just think I left the oven on at home after breakfast,

279
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:48,600
我们得走了
so we should get going.

280
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,520
谢天谢地
Thank God.

281
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,160
你早上吃的是麦片
No, you had cereal for breakfast.

282
00:09:51,620 --> 00:09:52,300
发生什么事了
What's going on?

283
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:54,357
我摔了一跤 好像把胳膊摔折了
I wiped out, and I think I broke my arm.

284
00:09:54,357 --> 00:09:56,180
我从来没这么疼过
I've never been in so much pain.

285
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:56,900
保持微笑
Keep smiling.

286
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:57,838
得送你去急诊室
Got to get you to an ER.

287
00:09:57,838 --> 00:09:58,950
不 不要 不要
No, don't! No, no!

288
00:09:58,950 --> 00:10:01,080
莉莉要是看到我受伤肯定不会想学骑车的
If Lily sees me hurt, she's never gonna get on a bike.

289
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,880
你摔是因为那个慢跑的裸男吧
You crashed because of that shirtless jogger, didn't you?

290
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:04,040
天啊 他是有够性感
Oh, my God. Right?

291
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,560
歌洛莉亚 我刚还在想你今天会不会来
Oh, Gloria! I was wondering if you were gonna be here today.

292
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:09,860
你来干什么
What are you doing here?

293
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,770
我得说 我还以为我已经厌倦瑜伽了
I got to say, I thought I was over yoga,

294
00:10:12,770 --> 00:10:15,200
可是昨天真是让我大开眼界
but yesterday was a real eye-opener.

295
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,040
大开"眼界"还是"腿界"啊
"Eye" or "Thigh"?

296
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:19,920
我觉得这个课很有挑战性
I thought it was a very challenging class,

297
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:22,481
还有我不太喜欢你暗示的东西
and I don't really appreciate anything else you're implying,

298
00:10:22,481 --> 00:10:23,421
因为你有点...
'cause you're a little...

299
00:10:23,904 --> 00:10:24,961
我怎么了
I'm what?

300
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:25,751
嫉妒
Jealous.

301
00:10:25,751 --> 00:10:28,060
嫉妒什么 嫉妒他蹭你吗
Of what? Of him rubbing you

302
00:10:28,060 --> 00:10:30,260
蹭得好像要把灯灵放出来了吗
like he was expecting a genie to come out?

303
00:10:30,260 --> 00:10:33,780
你一直都习惯成为男性的关注焦点
Look, you are so used to being the center of men's attention

304
00:10:33,780 --> 00:10:37,420
昨天你可能有点不开心 因为我也得到了
that yesterday, it probably bothered you that I... got some.

305
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:39,200
关注 仅此而已 仅仅是关注
Attention. That's all. Just attention.

306
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:42,180
你疯了吗 我都结婚了
That's insane. I am a married woman.

307
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:44,240
我一直都得不到什么关注
I am used to getting no attention.

308
00:10:45,060 --> 00:10:47,100
不 安吉 你离我只有一个转角
No, Angie, you're like right around the corner from me.

309
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,920
对 向左转 朝西走
Yeah, turn left, walk west,

310
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,680
我们美发沙龙门口见
and I'll see you in front of the hair salon.

311
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,500
好的 待会儿见
All right. See you in a minute.

312
00:10:52,580 --> 00:10:52,980
菲尔
Phil?

313
00:10:54,834 --> 00:10:56,106
不要啊
No!

314
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:58,980
你们准备干什么去
What are you guys up to?

315
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:00,200
我要上瑜伽课
I have a yoga class.

316
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,280
很明显 克莱尔也要一起去
And, apparently, Claire does, too.

317
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:03,640
你在这里干嘛
What are you doing here?

318
00:11:03,780 --> 00:11:05,322
正准备带我的胖爱尔兰客户
Oh, just on my way to show more houses

319
00:11:05,322 --> 00:11:09,018
安吉·整容婆去看房子
to my fat, Irish client, Angie O'Plasty.

320
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:10,328
我要进去了
I'm going in.

321
00:11:10,328 --> 00:11:12,783
我会告诉拉你到了
I will tell Ra that you're here.

322
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,400
拉是我们的瑜伽教练
Ra is our yoga instructor.

323
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,880
她肯定很厉害 你都连续两天来这儿了
Oh, she must be great. You're here two days in a row.

324
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,560
她是挺厉害的
She is great.

325
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,080
就是年纪有点大
She's a little old.

326
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,740
真不清楚我为啥那么说
Don't know why I said that.

327
00:11:24,965 --> 00:11:25,993
我得进去了
I got to go.

328
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,060
回[黑]家见
See you black home.

329
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:32,300
非常清楚我为什么那么说
Pretty sure I know why I said that.

330
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:36,060
这是我人生中最大的伤痛
This is the most pain I've ever been in in my life.

331
00:11:36,180 --> 00:11:38,257
况且我曾经还被马一脚踢到电铁丝网上呢
And a horse once kicked me into an electric fence.

332
00:11:38,257 --> 00:11:40,121
好了小卡 你的胳膊断了
Well, C-Cam, yeah, you broke your arm.

333
00:11:40,121 --> 00:11:41,200
你得去医院
You got to go to the hospital.

334
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,020
不 不着急
No. Not yet.

335
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:43,480
我先进房 泡个澡
I'll go in, draw myself a bath,

336
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:44,580
然后假装滑倒把胳膊给摔断了
pretend to fall and break my arm.

337
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,360
与此同时 你把你扭伤脚的时候
In the meantime, go get those painkillers

338
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,837
用的止痛药拿来
that they gave you when you twisted your ankle.

339
00:11:47,837 --> 00:11:49,040
我好像已经扔了
Oh, I think I threw those away.

340
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:49,340
真的吗
Did you?

341
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:51,060
还是你把它们放在你枕边的床头柜上了
Or are they in the nightstand next to your bed

342
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:52,640
因为它们是很好的红酒伴侣
because they go good with a glass of wine?

343
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,160
大爸
Dad?

344
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,180
怎么了
Yeah?

345
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:01,200
你能把这个打开吗
Can you open these?

346
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:01,860
当然可以了
'Course I can.

347
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,480
好 那你开吧
Well? Will you?

348
00:12:03,913 --> 00:12:05,725
可以呀 现在就要开吗
Uh...sure. Yeah. Now?

349
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:07,960
试试看
Let's see here.

350
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,460
那啥
Ooh, you know what?

351
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:10,640
要开这个其实有个很好玩的办法
There's a fun way to open these

352
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,780
不知道我有没有教过你
I don't know if I've ever taught you.

353
00:12:12,281 --> 00:12:13,787
搞定 我的妈呀
There! Whoopsie-daisy!

354
00:12:13,787 --> 00:12:15,869
祝你吃得开心 洗澡时间到
Bon appetit. Bath time!

355
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:17,380
好了 我拿来了
Okay, so, I got the --

356
00:12:17,380 --> 00:12:18,609
这是怎么回事
What happened here?

357
00:12:18,609 --> 00:12:19,940
大爸开的薯片
Daddy opened the chips.

358
00:12:19,940 --> 00:12:21,240
用什么开的 吹雪机吗
With what -- a snowblower?

359
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:30,380
那是什么声音呢
Oh, I wonder what that noise was.

360
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:32,500
真希望大爸没事
I hope Daddy's okay!

361
00:12:34,220 --> 00:12:35,500
-大爸 -噢 不
- Daddy! - Oh, no!

362
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,220
你看上去好像滑倒了 摔断了左手臂
Looks like you fell and broke your, uh, left arm.

363
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:38,800
不 米奇尔 我摔了 真心摔了
No, Mitchell, I fell. I really fell.

364
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:39,660
-这是真的吗 -真的
- Oh, really? - Really.

365
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:40,280
你没事吧
Are you okay?

366
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:42,020
头好痛 手臂也好痛
My head hurts. And my arm.

367
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,600
我再也不要洗澡了
I'm never taking a bath again!

368
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:44,520
这下好了
Oh, great.

369
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:46,180
你没从钢管上掉下来真是不幸
Too bad you didn't fall off a stripper pole.

370
00:12:46,342 --> 00:12:47,064
对不起
I-I'm sorry.

371
00:12:47,064 --> 00:12:48,842
那是左手臂 在左手边
That is the left. Left.

372
00:12:50,524 --> 00:12:52,820
艾丽克斯找的电脑宅给我的地址就是这儿
Well, this is the address Alex's nerds gave me,

373
00:12:52,820 --> 00:12:55,680
但我觉得这不像是挑衅鬼住的地方
but it's not where I pictured a troll living.

374
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:57,920
"自从主演《音乐之声》"
"After his performance in 'The Sound of Music,'"

375
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,740
"克里斯托弗·普卢默走上了杰出演员之路"
"Christopher Plummer went on to a distinguished acting career."

376
00:13:01,220 --> 00:13:03,600
"而自从看了迪尔加多的表演 我认为"
After Delgado's performance, I expect he'll go on

377
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,940
"他可以走上杰出水管工[谐音普卢默]之路"
"to a distinguished plumbing career."

378
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:07,600
专心点 你得给我明天的节目拍好这段
Focus! I need you to film this for my show tomorrow.

379
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:12,700
还有如果这个废物未成年 就得靠你揍他了
By the way, if the punk's under 18, you have to hit him.

380
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,680
什么 我可没同意这点
What?! I never agreed to that!

381
00:13:16,709 --> 00:13:17,440
普里契特
Pritchett?

382
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:17,880
厄尔
Earl?

383
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:20,360
你是在逗我吧
You've got to be kidding me.

384
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:21,743
你来这里干什么
What the hell are you doing here?

385
00:13:21,743 --> 00:13:24,320
我来打女士杀手的肥脸
I'm here to punch LadyKiller in his fat face.

386
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:27,360
抱歉能再来一遍吗 我调的是拍照模式
I'm sorry. Can we start over? I was on "Photo."

387
00:13:27,412 --> 00:13:29,160
继续吧 我准备好了
Go ahead. Any time.

388
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:31,460
你真可悲
You're pathetic.

389
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:33,360
我在衣柜生意上狠狠打败了你
I crushed you in the closet game,

390
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,900
我也要在互联网上打败你
and I'm crushing it on the Internet.

391
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:37,340
把那耗子放下 我要把你打趴在门口
Put that rat down, and I'll crush you on your porch.

392
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:40,220
这样也比不上你的没脑乱叫让人痛苦
Like that is gonna be any more painful than your stupid rant,

393
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:42,380
"餐厅什么时候变得这么吵了"
"When did restaurants get so loud?"

394
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:43,380
我早该知道是你
I should have known it was you --

395
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:45,460
你的短胖小手指打了那么多错字
all those typos from your stubby fingers.

396
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:47,060
怎么说话呢 我的手是像我妈
Watch it. I got my mother's hands.

397
00:13:47,060 --> 00:13:48,560
你的猥琐胡子也像你妈
You also have your mother's mustache.

398
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:50,420
-拿着 -帮我拿着
- Hold this! - Hold this.

399
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,620
整整撕了二十秒
That went on for a good 20 seconds.

400
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:02,000
我们干嘛要一直互撕
Why do we keep doing this?!

401
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:02,840
谁知道呢
Who knows?

402
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,217
你们还看不出来吗
Isn't it obvious?

403
00:14:04,217 --> 00:14:06,640
你们两个彼此需要 这就是原因
You two need each other. It's what drives you.

404
00:14:06,740 --> 00:14:07,900
这孩子说得对
The kid is right.

405
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:10,660
我起床有一半原因是为了战胜你
Beating you is half the reason I get out of bed.

406
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:11,900
纠缠不休的角斗
Locking horns.

407
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,760
我们促使彼此变得更好
We made each other better

408
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:14,900
比我想象的还要好
than I ever thought we could be.

409
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,080
把对方推到了伟大的高度上
Pushed each other to greatness.

410
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,320
不能更高
We touched the sky.

411
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,340
但是我们说的是衣柜生意 对吧
We're talking about closets here, right?

412
00:14:19,340 --> 00:14:21,100
抱歉 你是在说那个
Oh, I'm sorry -- You mean the sanctuary

413
00:14:21,100 --> 00:14:23,040
让男人早晨得以充分武装
where a man dons his armor in the morning

414
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:24,900
夜晚总结回顾一天战斗的圣所吗
and takes stock of the battle at night?!

415
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:27,040
我们所有人拥有的一个共同点
The one thing we all have in common --

416
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,620
不管是总统还是邮递员 大亨还是教师
presidents to postmen, tycoons to teachers,

417
00:14:29,780 --> 00:14:31,500
穿越四海
from sea to shining sea!

418
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,000
这剧情转变得也太诡异了
This is taking a weird turn.

419
00:14:33,060 --> 00:14:34,980
我们的确让彼此展现出了最好的一面
We did kind of bring out the best in each other,

420
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:35,297
不是吗
didn't we?

421
00:14:35,297 --> 00:14:37,890
你干嘛非得退休呢 普里契特
Why did you have to retire, Pritchett?

422
00:14:37,890 --> 00:14:38,840
我想念我们之间的火花
I miss the fire.

423
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:39,880
我猜我也无法割舍
I guess I miss it, too.

424
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:41,640
好吧 我想说
All right, here's something.

425
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,268
我们一起拍视频秀怎么样
What if we do the show together?

426
00:14:43,268 --> 00:14:44,720
什么 不要
What? No!

427
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,900
我才不会让你盯上我的新晋热门秀呢
I'm not gonna let you glom onto my new hit show!

428
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:47,841
阅读量只有43
43 views.

429
00:14:47,841 --> 00:14:50,972
我们可以做一期观点对立的那种节目
We could do like a -- like a point/counterpoint kind of thing.

430
00:14:50,972 --> 00:14:52,534
比如说我提出一个观点 像...
Like I would say something like, uh...

431
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:55,500
"废弃美分吧" 然后你的观点是
"Let's get rid of pennies," And you would say...

432
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,860
我们当然该弃用美分
Of course we should get rid of pennies!

433
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,000
美分用起来太烦了
They're annoying to own

434
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,460
要真扔了它们你又会不乐意
and make you feel bad when you throw them out.

435
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:01,591
好吧 那我就说"怀念送奶工"
All right, what -- what if I said "I miss milkmen"?

436
00:15:01,591 --> 00:15:03,080
谁不怀念呢
Who doesn't miss milkmen?

437
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:05,000
那牛奶瓶 那小领结
The glass bottle, little bow tie.

438
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,020
我是傻子吗 我会不怀念送奶工
What am I, an idiot? I don't miss milkmen?

439
00:15:07,020 --> 00:15:08,560
行 那你来出主意
Okay, well, then you think of something!

440
00:15:08,660 --> 00:15:09,760
我可不是被试镜的那个
I'm not the one auditioning.

441
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:10,500
好吧
Okay.

442
00:15:11,500 --> 00:15:14,520
我想到一个代表我独特思维的点子
Here's something that represents my unique brand of thinking.

443
00:15:14,771 --> 00:15:18,160
我坐飞机的时候 觉得行李费收得好
When I fly, I like luggage fees.

444
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:18,700
我也是
Me too.

445
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:21,080
我们这些随身携带行李的人凭什么
Why should us carry-on folk have to foot the bill

446
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,640
要替不懂打包行李的笨蛋承担费用呢
for those morons who don't know how to pack?!

447
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:24,459
整整三个星期 我从爱丁堡飞到华沙
Three weeks, I went from Edinburgh to Warsaw

448
00:15:24,459 --> 00:15:26,940
只穿两条裤子戴一顶苏格兰宽顶无沿圆帽
on two pairs of pants and a tam-o'-shanter.

449
00:15:26,940 --> 00:15:27,698
我快睡着了
I'm falling asleep.

450
00:15:27,698 --> 00:15:29,520
-我喜欢打个小盹 -谁不是呢
- I love naps! - Who doesn't?

451
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,436
这太可笑了
This is ridiculous!

452
00:15:30,436 --> 00:15:33,660
你觉得可笑是不是因为尽管你们是死敌
The irony that, despite you two being mortal enemies,

453
00:15:33,660 --> 00:15:35,160
但其实你们对任何事情的看法都一致
it appears you agree on everything?

454
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:35,520
才不是
No!

455
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,429
是因为这个混蛋竟然以为
It's that this jackass thinks

456
00:15:37,429 --> 00:15:39,840
他真能为《杰说心语》带来新创意
he can actually bring something new to "Jay Talking."

457
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,400
拜托 我们会超神的
Come on! We would be magic!

458
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,060
你已经从我这儿偷走了一家公司
You already stole one company from me.

459
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:44,113
你这次休想再得逞
You're not getting this.

460
00:15:44,113 --> 00:15:44,749
行 好
Okay, fine!

461
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:49,020
我要自己弄个节目
I will start my own show.

462
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:52,080
名字就叫《厄尔智言》
I'll call it... "Earls of Wisdom."

463
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:52,940
我等不及看了
Can't wait.

464
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:54,520
评论区见
I'll see you in the comments section.

465
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:56,200
我会关闭评论功能
I'll just turn the comments off.

466
00:15:56,860 --> 00:15:58,320
-这能实现吗 -能啊
- You can do that? - Yeah.

467
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:00,360
那我来这里搞什么
Then why am I here?!

468
00:16:02,220 --> 00:16:03,520
你真的不用这么做
Really, you don't have to do this.

469
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,120
如果我不送你来拿钥匙
If I don't drive you to get your keys,

470
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,500
你要怎么开车呢
how are you gonna get your car?

471
00:16:06,500 --> 00:16:07,360
谢谢
Well, thank you.

472
00:16:07,460 --> 00:16:08,400
那就是我家
This is me right here.

473
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:09,700
不是这里 不是这里 后两间
Not here. Not here. Two down.

474
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:11,000
我突然有点胃绞痛
Oh, there's a stomach cramp.

475
00:16:12,517 --> 00:16:14,121
好多了 就是那里
Much better. Uh, right here.

476
00:16:14,300 --> 00:16:17,180
邮箱地址"珀特菲尔德"[运输工原野]这家吗
With the mailbox that says "Porterfields"?

477
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:19,840
是的 这是我们跟邮差开的玩笑 说来话长
Yep. It is a joke that we play with the mailman. Long story.

478
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,280
我很快回来
I will be right back.

479
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:42,880
喂
Hello?

480
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,680
克莱尔 我是拉
Hey, Claire? It's Ra.

481
00:16:48,577 --> 00:16:50,979
来电显示是"伊拉·巴恩博"
The readout said "Ira Burnbaum".

482
00:16:50,979 --> 00:16:53,647
是的 "拉"是"伊拉"的简称
Yeah. Uh, "Ra" is short for "Ira."

483
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,740
我在想你要不要一起出来
Anyway, I was wondering if you wanted to get together,

484
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,000
洗个澡看个电影什么的
maybe grab a shower and a movie?

485
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,520
不 不
No. No.

486
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:00,940
我...
Oh, I am...

487
00:17:02,308 --> 00:17:05,125
伊拉 我结婚了 这是不可能的
Ira, I'm a married woman. That's not gonna happen.

488
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,780
我趴在你身上的时候没感受出来
I didn't pick up that energy when I was planking you.

489
00:17:09,875 --> 00:17:11,480
菲尔 你在家做什么
Phil! What are you doing home?

490
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,120
我丢了车钥匙 你在跟谁讲电话
I lost my car keys. Who were you talking to?

491
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:15,000
-没有谁 为什么你裤子破了 -没有为什么
- Nobody. Why are your pants ripped? - No reason.

492
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:16,540
找到了 待会见
Here they are. See you later!

493
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:25,840
你在这
There you are.

494
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:26,820
我们走吧
Off we go.

495
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,660
Phil 为什么你没让我看这幢房子
Phil, why didn't you show me this house?

496
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,840
它满足我所有的需求
It has everything I want.

497
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:31,080
我忘了它在待售了
I forgot it was for sale.

498
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:32,200
你可是中介
You're the agent.

499
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,237
我记起来了 它建得不好
I remember -- It's built cheap.

500
00:17:34,237 --> 00:17:36,560
我觉得挺结实的
It...looks pretty solid to me.

501
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:38,100
空有其表而已
Well, it's mostly held up by beehives.

502
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:38,720
走吧
Let's go.

503
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,060
菲尔 到底怎么了
Phil, what is going on?

504
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:42,120
没什么 只是不想让你住在次品房子里
Nothing. Just trying to keep you away from all that asbestos.

505
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,980
你不想让我当你的邻居吗
Do you not want me as a neighbor?

506
00:17:44,308 --> 00:17:45,261
好吧
Okay.

507
00:17:45,803 --> 00:17:48,260
我坚持不下去了 实话实说吧
I-I can't do this anymore. No more lies.

508
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:49,580
跟这有关
It is related to that.

509
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,080
我还真不知道你是个种族主义者
I did not peg you for a racist.

510
00:17:53,120 --> 00:17:54,800
等等 不 不 不 不
Wait. No, no, no, no, no!

511
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:56,040
等等 等等 安吉
Wait, wait, wait. Angie...

512
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,900
世事总是那么难料
It's always the last people you think.

513
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,520
我们结束了 再见 菲尔
We're done. Goodbye, Phil.

514
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:02,260
不 安吉 不是这样的
No, Angie! That's not it!

515
00:18:02,340 --> 00:18:03,440
我对我妻子撒了谎
I lied to my wife

516
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:05,620
因为她知道我对黑人有幻想
because she knows I have a thing for black women!

517
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:06,960
是吗
Oh, really?

518
00:18:07,020 --> 00:18:07,620
嘿
Hey, there!

519
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:10,440
所以那就是安吉吗
So, that was Angie O'Hara?

520
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:10,960
好吧
Okay.

521
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:12,760
我向你坦白
Full disclosure...

522
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:14,900
我确实说谎了
I did lie.

523
00:18:15,740 --> 00:18:19,040
但只是因为她很漂亮 而你又有点神经质
But only because she's beautiful and you get a little crazy.

524
00:18:19,540 --> 00:18:21,540
我到底是为什么要这么说
Why the hell did I say that?!

525
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:26,020
对不起
I'm sorry.

526
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:27,500
没关系
Oh, it's okay.

527
00:18:28,260 --> 00:18:30,240
你现在那么善解人意 太不像你了
You're being so understanding. It's so unlike you.

528
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:31,380
你是不是不为人知地疯了
Are you secretly mad?

529
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:33,940
你是不是在给我安全的错觉
Are you lulling me into a false sense of security?

530
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:35,900
你是不是要在我睡着的时候对我做什么
Are you gonna do something to me while I'm asleep?

531
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,800
菲尔 你知道真正让我生气的是什么吗
Phil, you know what really gets my goat?

532
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,580
是你说谎了
That you lied.

533
00:18:41,780 --> 00:18:42,340
看来男人都这样
Guess men are men.

534
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:43,960
不知道为什么我会有奢望
I don't know why I expected anything more.

535
00:18:45,716 --> 00:18:46,400
喂
Hello?

536
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:48,180
我想给你道歉 你说得对
I want to apologize. You were right.

537
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:51,580
拉只关心你确实让我生气
It did bother me that Ra gave you all the attention.

538
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:54,180
他是个有魅力的男人 而你是个非常性感的女人
He's an attractive man, and you're a very sexy woman.

539
